        "finalText":  "I\u0027ll start by reading the required files to understand the codebase structure and conventions.\r\nNow implementing runtimeRegistry changes:\r\nAll green. Let me align the scheduler\u0027s injectable tick interval with the spec (dep `checkEveryMs` defaulting to 30_000):\r\nDone. `npx vitest run src/main` → 849 passed (57 files); `npx tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.node.json --composite false` → zero errors.\n\nWhat I built:\n- `src/main/sleep/sleepPolicy.ts` — pure `pickSessionsToSleep` with clamped `afterMinutes`, active/closed/attention/activity/idle rules, missing touch = not idle.\n- `src/main/sleep/SleepScheduler.ts` — `createSleepScheduler` with injectable `setInterval`/`clearInterval`/`now`/`checkEveryMs` (default 30 000), `touch`/`forget`/`start`/`stop`, per-session error isolation via `onError`, and startup seeding of `lastTouchAt` so a fresh launch doesn\u0027t sleep everything.\n- `runtimeRegistry.ts` — `markSleeping` (exited, null code, attention/activity cleared); `markRunning`/`markExited` omit `sleeping` via `withoutSleeping`.\n- `sessionController.ts` — `sleepSession` (no-op for unknown/closed/non-running/asleep; clears start state, forgets attention, marks sleeping before kill), the pty exit handler ignores sleeping kills, and waking via `setActiveSession` resumes with `--resume`; reopen/restart/close/remove clear sleeping.\n- `store/settings.ts` + `settingsValidation.ts` — new `sleep` section accepted, validated (range 1..1440) and merged/persisted; fixes the missing-`sleep` type error.\n- `ipcHandlers.ts` — `IPC.sessionSleep` handler calling `controller.sleepSession(assertId(raw, \u0027session id\u0027))`.\n\nTests added: `runtimeRegistry.sleep.test.ts`, `sleepPolicy.test.ts`, `SleepScheduler.test.ts`, `sessionController.sleep.test.ts`, plus sleep cases in `settings.test.ts` / `settingsValidation.test.ts`.",
